{"id":"forecast-09","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-09/audio-2.mp3","model":"small","duration":320.3,"segments":[{"start":0.21,"end":2.49,"text":"Now turn to Section 2.","words":[["Now",0.21,0.87],["turn",0.87,1.27],["to",1.27,1.53],["Section",1.53,1.89],["2.",1.89,2.49]]},{"start":3.19,"end":4.05,"text":"Section 2.","words":[["Section",3.19,3.47],["2.",3.47,4.05]]},{"start":4.57,"end":8.37,"text":"You will hear a radio program about singing in a choir.","words":[["You",4.57,4.89],["will",4.89,5.09],["hear",5.09,5.33],["a",5.33,5.61],["radio",5.61,6.03],["program",6.03,6.63],["about",6.63,7.11],["singing",7.11,7.57],["in",7.57,7.95],["a",7.95,8.11],["choir.",8.11,8.37]]},{"start":9.03,"end":13.47,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 11 to 15.","words":[["First,",9.03,9.35],["you",9.79,9.97],["have",9.97,10.23],["some",10.23,10.49],["time",10.49,10.87],["to",10.87,11.11],["look",11.11,11.37],["at",11.37,11.61],["questions",11.61,11.95],["11",11.95,12.59],["to",12.59,12.93],["15.",12.93,13.47]]},{"start":14.51,"end":18.83,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 15.","words":[["Now",14.51,14.99],["listen",14.99,15.29],["carefully",15.29,15.81],["and",15.81,16.47],["answer",16.47,16.95],["questions",16.95,17.35],["11",17.35,18.01],["to",18.01,18.31],["15.",18.31,18.83]]},{"start":19.59,"end":23.13,"text":"And for our regular spot on Things to Do in Town,","words":[["And",19.59,20.33],["for",20.33,20.59],["our",20.59,20.75],["regular",20.75,21.17],["spot",21.17,21.59],["on",21.59,21.95],["Things",21.95,22.21],["to",22.21,22.47],["Do",22.47,22.65],["in",22.65,22.83],["Town,",22.83,23.13]]},{"start":23.51,"end":25.55,"text":"here's our reporter, Samuel Cooper.","words":[["here's",23.51,23.95],["our",23.95,24.13],["reporter,",24.13,24.49],["Samuel",24.81,25.13],["Cooper.",25.13,25.55]]},{"start":25.55,"end":29.97,"text":"It's been fun to write about joining some of our local choirs.","words":[["It's",25.55,26.41],["been",26.41,26.59],["fun",26.59,26.93],["to",26.93,27.15],["write",27.15,27.39],["about",27.39,27.65],["joining",27.65,28.11],["some",28.11,28.53],["of",28.53,28.71],["our",28.71,28.91],["local",28.91,29.33],["choirs.",29.33,29.97]]},{"start":30.55,"end":31.23,"text":"Thank you.","words":[["Thank",30.55,30.95],["you.",30.95,31.23]]},{"start":31.67,"end":38.27,"text":"Well, feeling a bit apprehensive about my ability to sing in tune, I recently headed off for","words":[["Well,",31.67,31.97],["feeling",32.53,32.97],["a",32.97,33.25],["bit",33.25,33.43],["apprehensive",33.43,34.19],["about",34.19,34.49],["my",34.49,34.77],["ability",34.77,35.23],["to",35.23,35.57],["sing",35.57,35.91],["in",35.91,36.07],["tune,",36.07,36.35],["I",36.87,37.07],["recently",37.07,37.41],["headed",37.41,37.79],["off",37.79,38.09],["for",38.09,38.27]]},{"start":38.27,"end":40.99,"text":"rehearsals at the town's three biggest choirs.","words":[["rehearsals",38.27,38.83],["at",38.83,39.09],["the",39.09,39.21],["town's",39.21,39.69],["three",39.69,39.95],["biggest",39.95,40.37],["choirs.",40.37,40.99]]},{"start":41.67,"end":47.57,"text":"Mitchell's Town Choir, the Black Bell Male Voice Choir, and the Caroline Singers.","words":[["Mitchell's",41.67,42.31],["Town",42.31,42.53],["Choir,",42.53,42.99],["the",43.51,43.71],["Black",43.71,43.99],["Bell",43.99,44.37],["Male",44.37,44.79],["Voice",44.79,45.29],["Choir,",45.29,45.79],["and",46.27,46.37],["the",46.37,46.51],["Caroline",46.51,46.87],["Singers.",46.87,47.57]]},{"start":48.13,"end":52.03,"text":"I received a very warm welcome at all three choirs.","words":[["I",48.13,48.49],["received",48.49,48.93],["a",48.93,49.25],["very",49.25,49.53],["warm",49.53,49.91],["welcome",49.91,50.31],["at",50.31,50.85],["all",50.85,51.19],["three",51.19,51.45],["choirs.",51.45,52.03]]},{"start":52.03,"end":56.75,"text":"They are always on the lookout for new and enthusiastic singers.","words":[["They",52.03,53.09],["are",53.09,53.33],["always",53.33,53.75],["on",53.75,54.05],["the",54.05,54.17],["lookout",54.17,54.49],["for",54.49,54.81],["new",54.81,55.15],["and",55.15,55.47],["enthusiastic",55.47,56.03],["singers.",56.03,56.75]]},{"start":57.69,"end":63.85,"text":"Now, obviously deciding which choir to join will depend to some extent on your taste in music.","words":[["Now,",57.69,58.07],["obviously",58.59,59.13],["deciding",59.13,59.83],["which",59.83,60.19],["choir",60.19,60.49],["to",60.49,60.73],["join",60.73,61.01],["will",61.01,61.25],["depend",61.25,61.57],["to",61.57,61.85],["some",61.85,62.11],["extent",62.11,62.43],["on",62.43,62.75],["your",62.75,62.91],["taste",62.91,63.27],["in",63.27,63.51],["music.",63.51,63.85]]},{"start":64.63,"end":71.59,"text":"Blackbell caters for most musical taste as it has a hugely varied repertoire as does Mitchelstown.","words":[["Blackbell",64.63,65.25],["caters",65.25,65.87],["for",65.87,66.15],["most",66.15,66.51],["musical",66.51,66.93],["taste",66.93,67.41],["as",67.41,67.89],["it",67.89,68.07],["has",68.07,68.27],["a",68.27,68.47],["hugely",68.47,68.79],["varied",68.79,69.31],["repertoire",69.31,69.89],["as",69.89,70.39],["does",70.39,70.71],["Mitchelstown.",70.71,71.59]]},{"start":72.21,"end":78.03,"text":"If you're after a more classical feel, the Caroline singers tend to focus on madrigals.","words":[["If",72.21,72.59],["you're",72.59,72.81],["after",72.81,73.13],["a",73.13,73.33],["more",73.33,73.51],["classical",73.51,73.99],["feel,",73.99,74.49],["the",75.01,75.15],["Caroline",75.15,75.49],["singers",75.49,76.09],["tend",76.09,76.43],["to",76.43,76.63],["focus",76.63,76.97],["on",76.97,77.33],["madrigals.",77.33,78.03]]},{"start":78.03,"end":81.33,"text":"that's unaccompanied singing without any instruments.","words":[["that's",78.03,78.87],["unaccompanied",78.87,79.65],["singing",79.65,80.03],["without",80.03,80.41],["any",80.41,80.71],["instruments.",80.71,81.33]]},{"start":82.23,"end":85.29,"text":"If you want to meet people who share an interest in music,","words":[["If",82.23,82.57],["you",82.57,82.73],["want",82.73,82.93],["to",82.93,83.09],["meet",83.09,83.29],["people",83.29,83.69],["who",83.69,83.89],["share",83.89,84.19],["an",84.19,84.35],["interest",84.35,84.67],["in",84.67,84.91],["music,",84.91,85.29]]},{"start":85.83,"end":88.65,"text":"Mitchell's Town Choir is a good place to start.","words":[["Mitchell's",85.83,86.33],["Town",86.33,86.55],["Choir",86.55,86.95],["is",86.95,87.27],["a",87.27,87.43],["good",87.43,87.63],["place",87.63,88.03],["to",88.03,88.27],["start.",88.27,88.65]]},{"start":89.41,"end":91.17,"text":"Apart from their own performances,","words":[["Apart",89.41,89.77],["from",89.77,90.05],["their",90.05,90.25],["own",90.25,90.47],["performances,",90.47,91.17]]},{"start":91.71,"end":94.45,"text":"they also arrange group visits to see operas","words":[["they",91.71,91.83],["also",91.83,92.23],["arrange",92.23,92.55],["group",92.55,92.95],["visits",92.95,93.33],["to",93.33,93.63],["see",93.63,93.87],["operas",93.87,94.45]]},{"start":94.45,"end":96.05,"text":"and attend music festivals.","words":[["and",94.45,94.71],["attend",94.71,94.93],["music",94.93,95.51],["festivals.",95.51,96.05]]},{"start":96.85,"end":99.61,"text":"So it can be a great way to make friends.","words":[["So",96.85,97.25],["it",97.25,97.47],["can",97.47,97.61],["be",97.61,97.81],["a",97.81,98.01],["great",98.01,98.27],["way",98.27,98.61],["to",98.61,98.85],["make",98.85,99.09],["friends.",99.09,99.61]]},{"start":100.21,"end":102.83,"text":"But it's not just a chance to develop a skill,","words":[["But",100.21,100.55],["it's",100.55,100.75],["not",100.75,100.93],["just",100.93,101.19],["a",101.19,101.41],["chance",101.41,101.67],["to",101.67,101.91],["develop",101.91,102.31],["a",102.31,102.53],["skill,",102.53,102.83]]},{"start":103.23,"end":105.41,"text":"travel or make friends that's on offer.","words":[["travel",103.23,103.57],["or",103.57,103.81],["make",103.81,104.03],["friends",104.03,104.45],["that's",104.45,104.91],["on",104.91,105.07],["offer.",105.07,105.41]]},{"start":105.41,"end":108.27,"text":"You could win a gold medal too!","words":[["You",105.41,106.45],["could",106.45,106.65],["win",106.65,106.95],["a",106.95,107.21],["gold",107.21,107.47],["medal",107.47,107.91],["too!",107.91,108.27]]},{"start":109.13,"end":114.49,"text":"Mitchell's Town are hoping to get to the final at the Melody Competition in Atlanta.","words":[["Mitchell's",109.13,109.77],["Town",109.77,109.97],["are",109.97,110.27],["hoping",110.27,110.57],["to",110.57,110.83],["get",110.83,111.05],["to",111.05,111.27],["the",111.27,111.41],["final",111.41,111.79],["at",111.79,112.19],["the",112.19,112.31],["Melody",112.31,112.73],["Competition",112.73,113.45],["in",113.45,113.95],["Atlanta.",113.95,114.49]]},{"start":115.47,"end":120.15,"text":"And Blackbell are the current holders of the Counter-Mail Voice Choir Award,","words":[["And",115.47,115.81],["Blackbell",115.81,116.35],["are",116.35,116.65],["the",116.65,116.79],["current",116.79,117.09],["holders",117.09,117.55],["of",117.55,118.11],["the",118.11,118.25],["Counter",118.25,118.55],["-Mail",118.55,118.87],["Voice",118.87,119.19],["Choir",119.19,119.61],["Award,",119.61,120.15]]},{"start":120.45,"end":125.33,"text":"which was presented to them by the director of the London Opera just last month.","words":[["which",120.45,120.73],["was",120.73,120.89],["presented",120.89,121.35],["to",121.35,121.71],["them",121.71,121.95],["by",121.95,122.15],["the",122.15,122.33],["director",122.33,122.77],["of",122.77,123.13],["the",123.13,123.25],["London",123.25,123.57],["Opera",123.57,124.01],["just",124.01,124.45],["last",124.45,124.85],["month.",124.85,125.33]]},{"start":126.29,"end":128.99,"text":"You can also be a part of a recording deal.","words":[["You",126.29,126.63],["can",126.63,126.81],["also",126.81,127.11],["be",127.11,127.35],["a",127.35,127.49],["part",127.49,127.71],["of",127.71,128.01],["a",128.01,128.17],["recording",128.17,128.57],["deal.",128.57,128.99]]},{"start":129.73,"end":133.79,"text":"Mitchell's Town has just joined Blackbell and Caroline Singers","words":[["Mitchell's",129.73,130.27],["Town",130.27,130.57],["has",130.57,130.87],["just",130.87,131.23],["joined",131.23,131.63],["Blackbell",131.63,132.23],["and",132.23,132.69],["Caroline",132.69,133.09],["Singers",133.09,133.79]]},{"start":133.79,"end":136.57,"text":"as recording artists for their first CD,","words":[["as",133.79,134.35],["recording",134.35,134.75],["artists",134.75,135.27],["for",135.27,135.49],["their",135.49,135.71],["first",135.71,135.99],["CD,",135.99,136.57]]},{"start":137.13,"end":138.71,"text":"due in shops in December.","words":[["due",137.13,137.37],["in",137.37,137.57],["shops",137.57,137.87],["in",137.87,138.23],["December.",138.23,138.71]]},{"start":139.57,"end":141.29,"text":"And if all of that isn't enough,","words":[["And",139.57,139.85],["if",139.85,139.97],["all",139.97,140.17],["of",140.17,140.29],["that",140.29,140.49],["isn't",140.49,140.85],["enough,",140.85,141.29]]},{"start":141.73,"end":144.01,"text":"you can also benefit the local community","words":[["you",141.73,141.89],["can",141.89,142.09],["also",142.09,142.41],["benefit",142.41,142.89],["the",142.89,143.17],["local",143.17,143.41],["community",143.41,144.01]]},{"start":144.01,"end":146.51,"text":"by helping to raise funds for good causes.","words":[["by",144.01,144.31],["helping",144.31,144.61],["to",144.61,144.89],["raise",144.89,145.07],["funds",145.07,145.45],["for",145.45,145.71],["good",145.71,146.01],["causes.",146.01,146.51]]},{"start":147.35,"end":149.79,"text":"Mitchell's Town regularly performs at functions","words":[["Mitchell's",147.35,147.85],["Town",147.85,148.05],["regularly",148.05,148.59],["performs",148.59,149.19],["at",149.19,149.41],["functions",149.41,149.79]]},{"start":149.79,"end":152.01,"text":"helping the disabled and the elderly.","words":[["helping",149.79,150.29],["the",150.29,150.51],["disabled",150.51,151.01],["and",151.01,151.43],["the",151.43,151.61],["elderly.",151.61,152.01]]},{"start":152.83,"end":155.67,"text":"While BlackBell donates a percentage of its profits","words":[["While",152.83,153.21],["BlackBell",153.21,153.77],["donates",153.77,154.23],["a",154.23,154.37],["percentage",154.37,154.67],["of",154.67,155.09],["its",155.09,155.27],["profits",155.27,155.67]]},{"start":155.67,"end":157.43,"text":"to certain local charities.","words":[["to",155.67,155.97],["certain",155.97,156.37],["local",156.37,156.75],["charities.",156.75,157.43]]},{"start":158.37,"end":161.09,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the program,","words":[["Before",158.37,159.09],["you",159.09,159.45],["hear",159.45,159.71],["the",159.71,159.91],["rest",159.91,160.23],["of",160.23,160.45],["the",160.45,160.59],["program,",160.59,161.09]]},{"start":161.09,"end":165.45,"text":"you have some time to look at questions 16 to 20.","words":[["you",161.09,161.73],["have",161.73,162.01],["some",162.01,162.33],["time",162.33,162.71],["to",162.71,162.97],["look",162.97,163.23],["at",163.23,163.47],["questions",163.47,163.79],["16",163.79,164.69],["to",164.69,164.99],["20.",164.99,165.45]]},{"start":166.27,"end":170.21,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 16 to 20.","words":[["Now",166.27,166.75],["listen",166.75,167.17],["and",167.17,167.59],["answer",167.59,168.05],["questions",168.05,168.47],["16",168.47,169.43],["to",169.43,169.71],["20.",169.71,170.21]]},{"start":171.43,"end":174.29,"text":"You may feel unable to join a choir","words":[["You",171.43,172.13],["may",172.13,172.37],["feel",172.37,172.67],["unable",172.67,173.13],["to",173.13,173.49],["join",173.49,173.81],["a",173.81,174.09],["choir",174.09,174.29]]},{"start":174.29,"end":178.19,"text":"because you're worried you'd struggle to find the time to attend rehearsals","words":[["because",174.29,174.65],["you're",174.65,175.01],["worried",175.01,175.35],["you'd",175.35,175.65],["struggle",175.65,175.99],["to",175.99,176.25],["find",176.25,176.53],["the",176.53,176.67],["time",176.67,176.99],["to",176.99,177.21],["attend",177.21,177.53],["rehearsals",177.53,178.19]]},{"start":178.19,"end":180.69,"text":"because of work or family commitments.","words":[["because",178.19,178.57],["of",178.57,179.05],["work",179.05,179.35],["or",179.35,179.63],["family",179.63,180.05],["commitments.",180.05,180.69]]},{"start":181.69,"end":184.13,"text":"Well, there is a solution to that.","words":[["Well,",181.69,182.11],["there",182.37,182.65],["is",182.65,182.97],["a",182.97,183.13],["solution",183.13,183.55],["to",183.55,183.81],["that.",183.81,184.13]]},{"start":184.89,"end":187.55,"text":"Start your own choir at work.","words":[["Start",184.89,185.25],["your",185.25,185.55],["own",185.55,185.85],["choir",185.85,186.31],["at",186.31,187.19],["work.",187.19,187.55]]},{"start":187.55,"end":193.03,"text":"work. This has been done in companies large and small, and I went to find out about the","words":[["work.",187.55,187.73],["This",188.17,188.51],["has",188.51,188.67],["been",188.67,188.87],["done",188.87,189.11],["in",189.11,189.25],["companies",189.25,189.65],["large",189.65,190.19],["and",190.19,190.47],["small,",190.47,190.91],["and",191.15,191.31],["I",191.31,191.53],["went",191.53,191.71],["to",191.71,191.91],["find",191.91,192.19],["out",192.19,192.45],["about",192.45,192.77],["the",192.77,193.03]]},{"start":193.03,"end":200.17,"text":"one at the accountants, John White. The choirs organizer, Elizabeth Arnold, told me the reason","words":[["one",193.03,193.27],["at",193.27,193.57],["the",193.57,193.69],["accountants,",193.69,194.37],["John",194.61,194.83],["White.",194.83,195.23],["The",196.07,196.43],["choirs",196.43,196.85],["organizer,",196.85,197.61],["Elizabeth",198.09,198.39],["Arnold,",198.39,198.95],["told",199.29,199.45],["me",199.45,199.67],["the",199.67,199.85],["reason",199.85,200.17]]},{"start":200.17,"end":205.87,"text":"she thinks people like the choir. She said that, while the thought of a big networking","words":[["she",200.17,200.45],["thinks",200.45,200.75],["people",200.75,201.09],["like",201.09,201.41],["the",201.41,201.57],["choir.",201.57,201.93],["She",202.69,203.09],["said",203.09,203.45],["that,",203.45,203.75],["while",204.13,204.27],["the",204.27,204.47],["thought",204.47,204.73],["of",204.73,205.01],["a",205.01,205.17],["big",205.17,205.41],["networking",205.41,205.87]]},{"start":205.87,"end":211.35,"text":"opportunities might be at the back of some people's mind, it's having the opportunity","words":[["opportunities",205.87,206.75],["might",206.75,207.19],["be",207.19,207.49],["at",207.49,207.67],["the",207.67,207.77],["back",207.77,208.03],["of",208.03,208.19],["some",208.19,208.43],["people's",208.43,209.03],["mind,",209.03,209.27],["it's",209.87,210.19],["having",210.19,210.47],["the",210.47,210.67],["opportunity",210.67,211.35]]},{"start":211.35,"end":216.69,"text":"to switch off and focus on something completely different, that thereafter.","words":[["to",211.35,211.71],["switch",211.71,211.99],["off",211.99,212.43],["and",212.43,212.99],["focus",212.99,213.37],["on",213.37,213.69],["something",213.69,214.05],["completely",214.05,214.67],["different,",214.67,215.17],["that",215.65,216.01],["thereafter.",216.01,216.69]]},{"start":217.65,"end":223.93,"text":"The people that join tend to be fairly competent singers to start with because, naturally enough,","words":[["The",217.65,218.07],["people",218.07,218.37],["that",218.37,218.61],["join",218.61,218.95],["tend",218.95,219.23],["to",219.23,219.41],["be",219.41,219.59],["fairly",219.59,219.97],["competent",219.97,220.47],["singers",220.47,220.97],["to",220.97,221.29],["start",221.29,221.61],["with",221.61,221.93],["because,",221.93,222.47],["naturally",222.95,223.43],["enough,",223.43,223.93]]},{"start":224.27,"end":226.81,"text":"people don't want to look bad in front of their colleagues.","words":[["people",224.27,224.51],["don't",224.51,224.81],["want",224.81,224.97],["to",224.97,225.15],["look",225.15,225.35],["bad",225.35,225.61],["in",225.61,225.81],["front",225.81,225.99],["of",225.99,226.15],["their",226.15,226.31],["colleagues.",226.31,226.81]]},{"start":227.81,"end":232.93,"text":"Companies like John White encourage their employees to set up choirs at work because","words":[["Companies",227.81,228.19],["like",228.19,228.57],["John",228.57,228.93],["White",228.93,229.31],["encourage",229.31,229.91],["their",229.91,230.21],["employees",230.21,230.81],["to",230.81,231.11],["set",231.11,231.33],["up",231.33,231.55],["choirs",231.55,232.01],["at",232.01,232.23],["work",232.23,232.53],["because",232.53,232.93]]},{"start":232.93,"end":236.11,"text":"it can help to create a healthier working atmosphere.","words":[["it",232.93,233.19],["can",233.19,233.35],["help",233.35,233.57],["to",233.57,233.75],["create",233.75,234.11],["a",234.11,234.39],["healthier",234.39,234.85],["working",234.85,235.33],["atmosphere.",235.33,236.11]]},{"start":236.11,"end":242.97,"text":"For example, people who previously didn't get on can find they have something in common,","words":[["For",236.11,237.55],["example,",237.55,238.03],["people",238.55,238.89],["who",238.89,239.15],["previously",239.15,239.67],["didn't",239.67,240.17],["get",240.17,240.39],["on",240.39,240.75],["can",240.75,240.99],["find",240.99,241.35],["they",241.35,241.61],["have",241.61,241.85],["something",241.85,242.25],["in",242.25,242.51],["common,",242.51,242.97]]},{"start":243.87,"end":246.09,"text":"which is just common sense really.","words":[["which",243.87,244.27],["is",244.27,244.51],["just",244.51,244.79],["common",244.79,245.25],["sense",245.25,245.67],["really.",245.67,246.09]]},{"start":246.89,"end":252.95,"text":"Elizabeth Arnold also stresses that you don't need a lot of people to get the choir off the ground.","words":[["Elizabeth",246.89,247.39],["Arnold",247.39,247.95],["also",247.95,248.47],["stresses",248.47,248.97],["that",248.97,249.33],["you",249.33,249.51],["don't",249.51,249.85],["need",249.85,250.13],["a",250.1